      "text": "In 2024, Canada euthanized 16,499 non-criminals. \n\nIn 2024, the United States executed 25 convinced criminals. \n\nIn 2025, Canada euthanized over 17,000 non-criminals. \n\nIn 2025, the United States executed 47 convinced criminals.",
